    "Summary": "Bootstraps dedicated-server administration with authenticated identities, explicit owners and editor testing.",
    "Description": "Provides trusted bootstrap, authenticated identities and explicit owner configuration inside one C# library. Add one Superuser Bootstrap to your game's network scene and explicitly enable its editor switch for testing. Public contracts and diagnostics are included; administration commands, permission resolution, durable storage and UI are not implemented yet.",
